              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akawaambia, Enendeni zenu mlimani, wale wanaowafuatia wasije wakawapata; mkajifiche huko siku tatu hata wao wanaowafuatia watakaporudi; kisha enendeni zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
